00:07.020 --> 00:10.020
of a GitHub repo on our GitHub account, right?

00:10.020 --> 00:12.150
It just makes a copy that we have access

00:12.150 --> 00:14.602
and permission to do whatever we want with,

00:14.602 --> 00:17.055
