00:39.480 --> 00:41.010
and make my own commits,

00:41.010 --> 00:43.290
I can't push those up, right?

00:43.290 --> 00:44.130
I don't have permission

00:44.130 --> 00:46.590
unless I ask to be a collaborator somehow.

00:46.590 --> 00:48.080
That's not how this works.

00:48.080 --> 00:49.860
That's not how GitHub works.

00:49.860 --> 00:51.990
So instead, if I wanna make my own changes

00:51.990 --> 00:54.030
and push them up to GitHub,

00:54.030 --> 00:55.500
maybe just to show other people,

00:55.500 --> 00:56.700
let's just start there.

