04:00.540 --> 04:05.190
Git add dot git commit dash M,

04:05.190 --> 04:07.143
change color palette.

04:08.280 --> 04:09.113
Cool.

04:09.113 --> 04:10.440
So I have that changed locally,

04:10.440 --> 04:11.670
